1
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,560
He's dead.

2
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:37,960
Mrs. He,

3
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,960
save me!

4
00:01:42,479 --> 00:01:43,360
Don't be afraid,

5
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,520
Mrs. He.

6
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,520
I'll protect you.

7
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,560
Where are we?

8
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,560
The orphanage I lived in as a kid.

9
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,280
It's been abandoned for a long time.

10
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,740
Are you sure no one's here?

11
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,960
Even if there is,

12
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,800
it's a ghost.

13
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:47,079
How are you so good at this?

14
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,840
From now on,

15
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,880
we're in

16
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,560
the same boat.

17
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:03,960
You asked me to look out for

18
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,020
news about Liu Dan.

19
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,720
His family called me this morning

20
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:07,320
saying they haven't reached him

21
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,920
in a while

22
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,980
and are worried something happened.

23
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,200
The housekeeper's disappearance

24
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,460
must have something to do with Zhang Xin.

25
00:03:28,880 --> 00:03:30,940
What exactly happened between them?

26
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,600
You're not trying to scare me
with candles again, are you?

27
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,560
Take them away.

28
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:47,770
Throw out all the candles in the house.

29
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,810
Throw them all away.

30
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:53,400
The housekeeper sends his regards.

31
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,400
Liu Dan!

32
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,360
Why are you bringing him up?

33
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,240
He gave me something very important.

34
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,920
He said...

35
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,200
What did he say?

36
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,360
If anything happens to me,

37
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:15,560
you must release this.

38
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,320
I guess

39
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,839
you know what this is.

40
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,880
Why would he team up with you?

41
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,560
If you really had something,

42
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,080
you would've released it already,

43
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,040
right?

44
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,880
Then let's wait and see.

45
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:46,560
No way.

46
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,600
Mrs. He,

47
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,280
Mrs. He,

48
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,280
Mrs. He,

49
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,120
Mrs. He,

50
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,800
Mrs. He,

51
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,000
Mrs. He,

52
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:19,120
do you know how cold it is underground?

53
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,240
Mrs. He,

54
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,400
He Shi,

55
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:37,050
I'm too tired.
Let's do it another day, He Shi.

56
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:41,680
What's wrong with you

57
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,640
so late at night?

58
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:44,840
I saw

59
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,280
the butler.

60
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,640
You must be dreaming.

61
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,200
Really.

62
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,560
He's haunting me now.

63
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,080
What should I do?

64
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,760
He's dead.

65
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,400
Why worry so much?

66
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,260
They actually killed the butler.

67
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,800
What are you doing?

68
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,800
Something unclean has appeared
in the house lately.

69
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,160
I specifically asked Dad

70
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:21,080
and got someone to perform a ritual.

71
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,760
I think the most unclean thing here

72
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,880
is you.

73
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,400
W-What

74
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:34,880
are you

75
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,040
looking at?

76
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:43,480
He's right behind you.

77
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,360
Don't move.

78
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,680
Let me listen.

79
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,880
He says

80
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:58,440
he was wronged.

81
00:06:59,360 --> 00:06:59,560
W-What

82
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,840
nonsense are you talking about?

83
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,040
He's come for you.

84
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:08,220
You'll never shake him off
for the rest of your life.

85
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,160
Then what should I do?

86
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:18,680
Where did you bury him?

87
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,960
Tell me.

88
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,920
I buried him...

89
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:24,040
Take him out.

90
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:27,160
He

91
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,600
is...

92
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,200
What is

93
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,240
he doing?

94
00:07:37,159 --> 00:07:38,440
He Shi,

95
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:43,240
this psychic seems

96
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,880
to really know everything.

97
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:46,940
Get out, all of you!

98
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,280
Yes.

99
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,409
What's going on?

100
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,880
Are you scared silly?

101
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,640
Doctor,

102
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,640
why has my dad been in the hospital
for so long this time?

103
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,240
When will he recover?

104
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:15,960
Miss,

105
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,400
there is actually something

106
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,930
the master hasn't told you.

107
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,120
With his current condition,

108
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,760
he urgently needs fresh bone marrow.

109
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:23,280
But bone marrow

110
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:24,800
isn't that easy to find.

111
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,840
And as his immediate family,

112
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,800
you should be the best match.

113
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,480
Why didn't you say so earlier?

114
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,679
I'm willing to donate.

115
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:33,600
That's great.

116
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:36,159
Let's do a detailed physical examination.

117
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,200
This way, please.

118
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,300
What are you doing?

119
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,880
I know everything now.

120
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,480
To keep me away from He Yu,

121
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,700
you actually used such dirty tricks.

122
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,080
It was clearly Zhang Xin
who kicked you out.

123
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,560
Why are you coming to me?

124
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,880
You're still making excuses.

125
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:05,520
You don't even know
you're being played as a pawn.

126
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,680
With your dullness,

127
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:09,200
don't you know Zhang Xin
and He Shi are having an affair?

128
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,280
Zhang Xin kicked you out

129
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:12,480
because she wants He Shi all to herself.

130
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:16,320
Aren't they in that kind of relationship?

131
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,520
What about Master He?

132
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,960
In the He family,

133
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:21,560
do you think
there are any morals or ethics?

134
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:24,090
If you don't believe me,

135
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,720
you can go and verify it.

136
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,970
It won't be too late to kill me then.

137
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,800
Sir!

138
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:56,920
Sir,

139
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,520
Li Zhangxin's medical report is out.

140
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,760
According to the report,

141
00:09:59,760 --> 00:10:01,800
her bone marrow is
a perfect match for yours.
